sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Settings Screen
    participant B as Connections Service

    UI->>UI: user pastes token into expand-row input; clicks Save
    UI->>B: PUT /api/connections/{id} { "token": "hshpat_abc…" }
    B->>B: strip whitespace; reject empty / control chars (422)
    B->>B: store token; status → connected
    B-->>UI: 200 { id, status: "connected", username: null, error_message: null }
    UI->>UI: collapse expand-row; refresh connection card

    alt token empty or invalid format
        B-->>UI: 422 Validation error
        UI->>UI: show inline error on input
    end

    alt unknown conn_id
        B-->>UI: 404 Not found
    end